{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-3", "avgTag": "行動後", "storyName": "無解的謎題", "storyInfo": "能否成為負責人尚需投票，本以為十拿九穩的緹緹終於意識到，薩爾貢過去的侵略在米諾斯人心中留下的仇恨，僅憑真心與熱情是無法消弭抹去的。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g9_templetheater_n", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$path_intro", "key": "$path_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.4, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "仁愛又英勇的建國英雄克瑞斯拉，哪怕是夜晚也無法抹去您身上的輝光。", "name": "醉酒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2"}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是您庇護第一神殿的工匠，帶來兩位智者，替我們排憂解難，替您修建殿堂。", "name": "醉酒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "蟲鳴代替您手中的豎琴作響，頭冠由後人編織出勝利的形狀，而月光——", "name": "醉酒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，對不起，您身上閃爍的不是月光，是我們上週安裝的探照燈。", "name": "醉酒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（暢快的飲酒聲）", "name": "醉酒的工匠"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "讓你不要喝這麼多，你還記得我們今晚是來參加投票的嗎？等一下刻陶片的時候，小心不要讓自己的手受傷了。", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然記得，我是來為緹緹小姐投票的！", "name": "醉酒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "昨天我一個人在神殿內廳處理雕像的時候差點摔倒了，要不是緹緹小姐用她的源石技藝幫了我，我現在就喝不到酒了。", "name": "醉酒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃……", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "醉酒的工匠", "content": "你是不是不信？"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "醉酒的工匠", "content": "我表演一下給你看，當時我被雕像拖到地面的衣帶絆倒，然後——"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "醉酒的工匠", "content": "哎喲！"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小心！", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "幾條柔軟潔白的布帶從暗處伸出，像有意識般地向醉酒的女孩飛去，幫她穩住重心。"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "確認對方無礙後，它們放鬆了布帶，撫過女孩被意外弄亂的頭髮，責怪地拍打著豐蹄女孩的雙角。"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2", "posfrom": "-200,-30", "posto": "0,0", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看到沒？然後我就被另一些衣帶救了，是不是很神奇！", "name": "醉酒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸？緹緹小姐你怎麼來了？一起喝酒啊！", "name": "醉酒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帕拉斯曾跟我說過搬運隊裡有個女孩很愛喝酒，個子小但力氣大，就是很容易跌倒。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒想到短短三天，我就看你摔了至少十次，坎提亞。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝謝你，緹緹小姐。", "name": "醉酒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2072_1#1$2"}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她的酒量就是米諾斯人的平均水準，不能多喝。原本米諾斯人喝酒就是小酌怡情，哪知道她有一顆老酒鬼的心。", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "倒是你，緹緹小姐，需不需要來一杯？", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我看起來……是不是很緊張？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "臉上看不出來，但這幾天相處下來，工程隊的大家都知道，這位菲林小姐的尾巴藏不住心事。", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹小姐，鷹架下那個灰尾巴上戴葉子飾環的是誰？", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薩瑞芬，粉刷組的，只有跟身材健壯的粉刷工分在一起才有幹勁，他說自己只是愛偷懶，所有人都不相信。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1"}, {"id": 78, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那蹲在角落裡不跟任何人打招呼的埃拉菲亞呢？", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "萊夫特瑞斯，雕刻組的，只有在太陽照不到的地方才能找到她。我跟她也就聊過幾句，但我知道她對自己的作品一心一意。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大部分工匠到現在為止甚至都不知道萊夫的存在，而你對她的瞭解已經不少了。", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹小姐，我不知道別人會如何評價你和你的身分，但對我而言，你就是我們中的一員。", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 85, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1"}, {"id": 87, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝謝你，馬諾斯。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 89, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g11_firsttemple_indoor", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不去安慰你的朋友嗎？她看起來有點緊張。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "體恤人心是你的專長，恩底彌翁神殿的卡珊卓拉小姐。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹現在需要的不是一個朋友的安慰，而是親身參與神殿建設的米諾斯人的支持。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 103, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在那兩位好心的工匠跟她搭話之前，梅捷緹克緹小姐一直在默誦稍後的演講詞。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一旦舌頭打結了，她就會不由自主地抓住自己的尾巴，有兩次還不小心抓了身邊那隻小寵物的皮毛，惹得牠很不高興。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "觀察得這麼仔細？看來你也蠻喜歡緹緹的嘛。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "僅憑這些，還不足以證明她是值得信任的人。我只是不想因為偏見，放棄用自己的眼睛進行確認的權利。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你早就認定她是神殿建設負責人的最佳人選，我會尊重你的眼光。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今天晚上，克瑞斯拉的雙眸中沒有迷困之徒的陰影，大家心中都有了自己的決定，無需英雄的代言人開解。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然如此，我還有一些個人問題需要處理，就先告辭了。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你要走了？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明面上主導神殿重建的祭司不參與投票，恐怕會被理事官小姐歪曲成某種示威。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心，我的陶片已經在投票箱裡了。況且里底婭小姐要是想找神殿祭司們的過錯，根本不需要這麼明顯的藉口。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "交換儀式若是在第一神殿舉辦，那奉請眾英雄的戲劇儀式……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我會找里底婭小姐再商量一次，至少讓她把選擇劇目的權力還給雅賽努斯祭司。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過那都是後話了，先祝今晚的投票一切順利。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g9_templetheater_n", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_dia_street_intro", "key": "$m_dia_street_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_mictest", "volume": 0.5, "channel": "2"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——如上所述，經由這幾日我在此參觀的體驗，石材的問題解決之後，我認為這座建築的主體部分已接近完成，可以供遊客參觀。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只要按照計劃完成收尾工作，一一驗收，幾日後就能正式對外開放。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "另外，若將交換儀式定在廣場上，所需的工作量也不多。只要整理出空間，再劃出一片提供後勤服務的區域即可。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "建築的其他部分仍可保持不變，等日後徹底完成再全面開放。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我將依據施工規劃的專業知識和經驗，整理出一份可執行的方案。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若我當選，那明天開始我會正式跟大家一起，完成這座恢弘的克瑞斯拉第一神殿！", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 147, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哎呀，今夜的神殿廣場真是盛況空前，看來這位梅捷緹克緹小姐待人足夠真誠，也很有討人喜歡的本事。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是她能順利上任，無論對兩國之間的友誼還是對神殿的收尾工作，都大有好處啊！", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您想要什麼？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我怎麼聽不懂理事官小姐的話，我只是應邀來觀禮的嘉賓之一啊？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "科林尼亞的商人之子，在我與薩爾貢大使小姐商談的過程中恰巧經過，隨口提出問題的解決方法，順利促成了今晚的投票儀式。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這一切只是因為克瑞斯拉保佑？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有何不可呢？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "按照傳統，受到庇護的米諾斯人還需隔天到神殿拜訪祭司，坦率地陳述自己已經領受了英雄的祝福。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，哪怕恩底彌翁神殿離理事官辦公室再近，您也不會去找卡珊卓拉祭司的，對嗎？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 170, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您越界了，佩里安德洛斯祭司。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你我心知肚明，梅捷緹克緹小姐的上任對您而言不僅是在外交領域錦上添花。您更關注的，與我一樣，從來都是米諾斯自己的家事。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#7$1"}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "提出您的訴求吧，再精妙的口才也無法在我看到交易條款之前，說服我應允。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 175, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈哈，別著急，雅賽努斯的理事官小姐。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "做商人最講究的就是誠信。待事情塵埃落定，我自會登門找您做生意的。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在還沒到時候。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g9_templetheater_n", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那麼，按照我們的傳統，請各位在手中的陶片背面刻上“同意”或“反對”。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "接著將陶片的背面朝下，放入此處的投票箱中。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所有人投票完畢後，我們將一起來統計最終的投票結果。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若“同意”超過半數，緹緹……梅捷緹克緹小姐就將負責這座神殿到文物交接儀式完成前的建設工作。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "開始吧。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.4, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.3, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "人們紛紛上前，將手中的陶片放入投票箱中。", "x": 300.0, "y": 370.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "投票箱的放置地點與緹緹所站的廣場中心之間有一段距離，但她依然能夠看到她在前幾日剛認識的朋友們微笑的臉。", "x": 300.0, "y": 370.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "視線相交時，他們會向緹緹點頭致意。", "x": 300.0, "y": 370.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "雖然看不到他們手中陶片上刻的字，但緹緹知道他們投出的是哪種票。", "x": 300.0, "y": 370.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "誰能想到呢？她想，竟然能主持一座米諾斯神殿的建造。即使是在瑪拉帕夏的時代，這也是一份極為榮耀的工作。", "x": 300.0, "y": 370.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "雅賽努斯人對她展現出了莫大的善意，她又該如何回報？", "x": 300.0, "y": 370.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵，真滑稽。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一個突兀的聲音打斷了緹緹的思緒，也讓廣場上的嘈雜聲瞬間消失。"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今年真是1100年嗎？", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我還以為自己是回到了一百年前，薩爾貢人又來統治我們了。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 229, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "戰爭已經結束了，墨格斯。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 235, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對你而言或許如此，但於我，不是。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薩爾貢的敵人依然會出現在我最黑暗的夢中，讓我無法擺脫。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也想像你們那樣健忘，但是我們的英雄透過夢境告訴我不可以。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 241, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "為你解夢的祭司是這樣說的？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1"}, {"id": 246, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不。但那些重複的夢境是英雄對我的指示，只有我才最清楚地知道他們的心意。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我沒辦法跟一個薩爾貢人有說有笑地共事。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 252, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪怕所有人都告訴我，那個薩爾貢人做的事是好的，結果也是好的，我依舊無法忍受。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 253, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "69_i04", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_69_i04_1", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "pfrom": "-150,0", "pto": "-150,0"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_69_i04_2", "style": "cg", "layer": 2.0, "pfrom": "-482,0", "pto": "-482,0"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_69_i04_3", "style": "cg", "layer": 3.0, "pfrom": "-220,0", "pto": "-220,0"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_69_i04_4", "style": "cg", "layer": 4.0, "pfrom": "0,216", "pto": "0,216"}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$dignified_intro", "key": "$dignified_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rapidbreath_female", "loop": "true", "channel": "1", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹看到那位米諾斯人從她面前走過，一眼也沒有看她。"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "經過投票箱時，他隨手拋出了陶片。那枚小小的碎片擦著箱子落在地上，轉動了幾下，最終靜止時，朝上的是空無一字的背面。"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹意識到，他對薩爾貢人的厭惡之深，讓他甚至不屑於參與這個環節，刻下反對的意見。"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.8, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.5}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_69_i04_1", "fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.5}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她像是挨了一記重重的耳光。她的臉頰在燃燒，背上卻因為感受到了寒意而戰慄。"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.6, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 4.0}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.5}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "周圍的一切變得極為遙遠，所有的人、所有的聲音，都像隔著一層厚厚的膜，顯得如此疏離，無法靠近。"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在她身側的帕拉斯似乎上前了一步，不遠處的工匠們也都向她投來了目光，可能是在擔心。"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她想說自己很好，她沒事，身為惡行累累的侵略者——薩爾貢人派來的和平使節，早就做好了遭到羞辱的心理準備。"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "更何況那位米諾斯人也沒有羞辱她，只是不想與她共事而已。沒關係的，誰也不可能招所有人喜歡。"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她想笑一笑，露出梅捷緹克緹-娜蘇圖-瑪夏耶爾的招牌笑容，那種開朗、無憂無慮的神情曾感染過博物館中的每一位客人。"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但她一句也說不出來，一下也笑不出來。"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.2, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 4.0}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_69_i04_2", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_69_i04_4", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 4.5}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_tinnitus_loop", "loop": "true", "channel": "2", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 4.0}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_69_i04_3", "fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.2, "channel": "1", "fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.6, "channel": "2", "fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 4.5}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她腦海中迴盪著那位扔下陶片的米諾斯人的話語，想起第一天來到雅賽努斯時，渡口的那位質問她的擺渡人。"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她與神殿工匠相處的時光並沒有作假，他們依舊信任自己。"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但在茫茫陌生的米諾斯人眼中，她不是異想天開、熱愛米諾斯傳說的緹緹，而是一個薩爾貢人。"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "1", "fadetime": 6.0}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "2", "fadetime": 6.0}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 4.0}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "69_i05", "fadetime": 5.0, "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 5.5}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "人都走了，探照燈都關了，你還要繼續縮在這裡？那個豐蹄小妹妹和神殿的工匠們好像都很擔心你。", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼？你打算讓所有人都休息，然後靠你的雙手和那些破布帶子，連夜把神殿蓋好，向米諾斯人賠罪？", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，我剛剛一直在你旁邊繞圈用眼神暗示你，但凡你低頭看我一眼……你就不覺得有哪裡不對勁嗎？", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "討人厭的副使找藉口不願出席投票儀式，撇清關係；那個叫里底婭的理事官明顯對你另有所圖，你竟然還主動跳進人家的圈套裡。", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這下好了，看看你現在，好狼狽哦！", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是吧小丫頭，哭了？就這點小事，我在萬王之王的黃金城——把捧高踩低當作日常雜耍的地方，見過不知道多少次！", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，我猜你也不是在為那些利用你的人難過。", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "接到帕夏任務的時候我就提醒過你，這趟行程必定不會是一次開開心心的出遊。", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那段無法被遺忘的歷史、還未從傷痛中恢復的米諾斯人、薩爾貢大使的身分，都會反覆提醒你，你要處理的不只是文物交換這一件事。", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$warm_intro", "key": "$warm_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "趾高氣揚的生物難得露出關心的表情，試圖從衣袖底下辨認出菲林女孩的神情，可惜她頭壓得太低，無法看清。"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "米奧嘆了口氣，用腦袋頂了頂緹緹的手，把自己團在女孩身邊，示意她撫摸自己。"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "毛茸茸的東西能讓人有好心情，你說的。", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我特別准許你撫摸我的尾巴，發洩式地弄亂我的背毛，或者用來擦乾你的眼淚。", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "擦眼淚還是算了，我討厭被弄濕。", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，我為什麼會挑中你這個又脆弱、又會到處惹麻煩的小東西？竟然還要我來安慰。", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "噗……", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是我真的那麼脆弱，當初你離開大巴扎的時候，就不會選上我了，對吧？", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿，你還開始自誇了。看在你心情不好的分上，只此一次，下不為例。", "name": "米奧"}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝謝你，米奧。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g9_templetheater_n", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "恢復精神了？", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#2$1"}, {"id": 344, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。只要有人在陶片上刻了我的名字，就代表他信任我，對我有所期待。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "馬諾斯說過，我已經是工匠中的一員了。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 347, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在一個家庭中，人尚且會有討厭的家人，或者老死不相往來的親戚，更何況我現在是在一個曾遭受薩爾貢傷害的國度。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1"}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我無法像傳說中的米諾斯英雄一樣，用一曲音樂、一首長詩、一番說辭，奇蹟般地解決所有問題。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1"}, {"id": 350, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我能做的就是讓這座克瑞斯拉第一神殿儘快完工，把早該歸還的、屬於米諾斯的東西，重新交回他們手裡，交回克瑞斯拉手裡。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 352, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "月亮照亮克瑞斯拉的臉龐，她仍頭頂桂冠，撥弄琴弦，望著無盡的遠方。"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹站在高大的大理石雕像下，與克瑞斯拉沐浴著同一片寂靜的月光，她閉上眼睛，許下了一個願望。"}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}